Description:
Delightful central apartment, in the heart of the Monti district. Reserved, quiet, romantic.
Easily accessible on foot or by public transport from Roma Termini central station and a stone's throw from the Metro.
10-minute walk from:
- Colosseum and Imperial Forums;
- Colle Oppio Park, Trajan's Baths, Domus Aurea;
- Basilica of San Pietro in Vincoli with the majestic Moses by Michelangelo and many of the infinite beauties of Rome.
